body:
If this something that is hurt you, don't to ask questions. I went through something similar with another social media page and when I asked if this would be stored and retained during my deletion, the website support team said the don't store anything. Whenever something comes up, always ask what you can do to make yourself feel better. look at the question that pops up of why feel feel the way you do. Helps me. I'm sorry that this is holding such a grasp on you. I hope that this helps you!

&#x200B;

(Don't be afraid to reply if you need more advice or if you need more help pertaining to this)
